{"id":"c18","stage":2,"title":"处理一个小问题","scene":"向店员说明故障并提出请求。","roles":["店员","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c18-1","ko":"어떤 문제로 오셨어요?","zh":"您是因为什么问题来的？","note":"-(으)로 在这里表示原因。","words":[{"term":"문제","zh":"问题","id":"bc0fca46ae9a4879","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/6bdfa7b98f9589fd3668.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"어떤","meaning":"什么","explanation":"어떤询问问题的种类。","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"문제로","meaning":"因为问题","explanation":"문제（问题）+ 로（原因）。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문제로","audio":"/audio/ddbfe77df1ed0f3a0338.mp3"}},{"text":"오셨어요?","meaning":"您来的？","explanation":"오다（来）+ -시-（尊敬）+ -었-（过去）+ -어요 → 오셨어요。","readings":[{"term":"오셨어요","audio":"/audio/c9db67d1006b18e0b44d.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오셨어요","audio":"/audio/c9db67d1006b18e0b44d.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c18-2","ko":"어제 산 이어폰에서 소리가 안 나요.","zh":"昨天买的耳机没有声音。","note":"산 是 사다 的过去定语形式。","words":[{"term":"사다","zh":"买","id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"},{"term":"이어폰","zh":"耳机","id":"e9fdbe020b266dd3","audio":"/audio/e9fdbe020b266dd328b0.mp3"},{"term":"소리","zh":"声音","id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/d3e717ec54483a76ad36.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天","explanation":"어제说明购买时间。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"산","meaning":"买的","explanation":"사다（买）+ -ㄴ（过去定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}},{"text":"이어폰에서","meaning":"耳机里","explanation":"이어폰（耳机）+ 에서（声音的来源）。","readings":[{"term":"이어폰","audio":"/audio/e9fdbe020b266dd328b0.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이어폰에서","audio":"/audio/e780d02e1b6a6a7ed860.mp3"}},{"text":"소리가","meaning":"声音","explanation":"소리（声音）+ 가（主格）。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소리가","audio":"/audio/0c12216fc63402c5db52.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안是否定副词。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"나요.","meaning":"出来","explanation":"나다（出现）→ 나요；소리가 나다表示发出声音。","readings":[{"term":"나요","audio":"/audio/ad7945a49b70f6a53963.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나요","audio":"/audio/ad7945a49b70f6a53963.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c18-3","ko":"영수증을 가지고 계세요?","zh":"您带着收据吗？","note":"가지고 계시다 是 가지고 있다 的敬语。","words":[{"term":"영수증","zh":"收据","id":"967b724471111627","audio":"/audio/967b7244711116274eea.mp3"},{"term":"가지다","zh":"持有","id":"f3b684d86e5485ed","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/6c70466f42758b217e53.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"영수증을","meaning":"收据","explanation":"영수증（收据）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"영수증","audio":"/audio/967b7244711116274eea.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영수증을","audio":"/audio/711260f977464ce8f7e2.mp3"}},{"text":"가지고","meaning":"拿着","explanation":"가지다（持有）+ -고，连接계시다。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가지고","audio":"/audio/2e847f33430d128ed48a.mp3"}},{"text":"계세요?","meaning":"您有吗？","explanation":"계시다是있다的尊敬形式；가지고 계시다表示持有。","readings":[{"term":"계세요","audio":"/audio/2a553f6887a157749fb2.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계세요","audio":"/audio/2a553f6887a157749fb2.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c18-4","ko":"네, 여기 있어요. 교환할 수 있나요?","zh":"带了，在这里，可以换货吗？","note":"-(으)ㄹ 수 있다 表示可能性。","words":[{"term":"교환하다","zh":"交换；换货","id":"41a806c0ef662aae","audio":"/audio/41a806c0ef662aae8dc0.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/f72e96fe2153c09e9183.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"有","explanation":"네肯定回答。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里","explanation":"여기是指示地点的词，에可省略。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"있어요.","meaning":"在","explanation":"있다（在）的礼貌形式。","readings":[{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}},{"text":"교환할","meaning":"换货","explanation":"교환하다（换货）+ -ㄹ，修饰수。","readings":[{"term":"교환하다","audio":"/audio/41a806c0ef662aae8dc0.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"교환할","audio":"/audio/feaef2f1563479333132.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可能","explanation":"수与있다组成“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있나요?","meaning":"能吗？","explanation":"있다 + -나요（礼貌疑问）；-ㄹ 수 있나요询问是否可以。","readings":[{"term":"있나요","audio":"/audio/0eb260e471116d837abb.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있나요","audio":"/audio/0eb260e471116d837abb.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c18-5","ko":"확인한 뒤에 새 제품으로 바꿔 드릴게요.","zh":"确认后，我给您换成新产品。","note":"-ㄴ 뒤에 表示之后。","words":[{"term":"확인하다","zh":"确认","id":"895c2bcd51e10cf1","audio":"/audio/895c2bcd51e10cf1d30a.mp3"},{"term":"제품","zh":"产品","id":"60be380dfd52bdfe","audio":"/audio/60be380dfd52bdfeffe2.mp3"},{"term":"바꾸다","zh":"更换","id":"5cc3393b01c955d1","audio":"/audio/5cc3393b01c955d1c3fb.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/1467588a4fc2403bbdef.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"확인한","meaning":"确认过的","explanation":"확인하다（确认）+ -ㄴ（过去定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"확인하다","audio":"/audio/895c2bcd51e10cf1d30a.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"확인한","audio":"/audio/57509b9c35ff18d4e2f1.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤에","meaning":"之后","explanation":"뒤（后）+ 에（时间）；-ㄴ 뒤에表示做完之后。","readings":[{"term":"뒤에","audio":"/audio/0350898692fd4601facb.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤에","audio":"/audio/0350898692fd4601facb.mp3"}},{"text":"새","meaning":"新的","explanation":"새是修饰名词的限定词。","readings":[{"term":"새","audio":"/audio/e2d38c50201cf36dbda0.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새","audio":"/audio/e2d38c50201cf36dbda0.mp3"}},{"text":"제품으로","meaning":"换成产品","explanation":"제품（产品）+ 으로（变化结果）。","readings":[{"term":"제품","audio":"/audio/60be380dfd52bdfeffe2.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제품으로","audio":"/audio/279a92352f8ddfac778f.mp3"}},{"text":"바꿔","meaning":"更换","explanation":"바꾸다（换）→ 바꿔，连接드리다。","readings":[{"term":"바꾸다","audio":"/audio/5cc3393b01c955d1c3fb.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바꿔","audio":"/audio/aaf9f253fd04921d1f86.mp3"}},{"text":"드릴게요.","meaning":"我会为您","explanation":"드리다 + -ㄹ게요；-아/어 드리다表示尊敬地为对方做事。","readings":[{"term":"드릴게요","audio":"/audio/e61f9f5edc04f979cd3a.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드릴게요","audio":"/audio/e61f9f5edc04f979cd3a.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c18-6","ko":"감사합니다. 얼마나 걸릴까요?","zh":"谢谢，大概要多久？","note":"얼마나 询问程度或时间长度。","words":[{"term":"감사하다","zh":"感谢","id":"552d49e405b9383e","audio":"/audio/552d49e405b9383e0803.mp3"},{"term":"얼마나","zh":"多么；多久","id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/6e67801c7768b1779352.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"감사합니다.","meaning":"谢谢","explanation":"감사하다（感谢）+ -ㅂ니다（正式礼貌体）。","readings":[{"term":"감사하다","audio":"/audio/552d49e405b9383e0803.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감사합니다","audio":"/audio/9d3815f2e8ff35e316cf.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多久","explanation":"얼마나询问程度，此处问时间长度。","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}},{"text":"걸릴까요?","meaning":"需要呢？","explanation":"걸리다（花费时间）+ -ㄹ까요（询问估计）。","readings":[{"term":"걸릴까요","audio":"/audio/82dad364363767ac5e9c.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸릴까요","audio":"/audio/82dad364363767ac5e9c.mp3"}}]}],"day":86,"sequenceScore":1.6267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":2,"options":["您还保留着包装吗？","您已经办理退款了吗？","您带着收据吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":4,"options":["确认后，我给您换成新产品。","确认后，我给您退钱。","确认前，您必须再买一个。"],"answer":0}